@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam activityBorderColor #64748B
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam swimlaneTitleBackgroundColor #F1F5FB

|买家|
start
:打开商品详情;
:点击「预约」;
|系统|
:校验登录状态与商品当前状态;
if (商品可预约？) then (否)
  :提示「已被预约 / 当前状态不可预约」;
  stop
else (是)
  :创建预约记录（待确认）;
  :商品转为「已预约」;
  |卖家|
  :收到预约通知;
  |系统|
  :等待卖家确认或买家取消;
  if (卖家确认交易？) then (确认)
    :预约与商品转为「已确认」;
    |买家|
    :线下交付;
    :确认完成;
    |系统|
    :商品与预约转为「已完成」;
    stop
  else (买家取消)
    :预约作废，商品恢复「已发布」;
    stop
  endif
endif
@enduml
